### Initiate payment (first time)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/payments/initiate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "amount": 80498.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "test-key-abc-123",
  "gateway": "razorpay"
}

